WEBVTT

00:00:26.773 --> 00:00:30.318
Yet here is a scientist
and a TED speaker

00:00:30.359 --> 00:00:32.612
making it sound good.

00:00:33.905 --> 00:00:35.114
It sent me on a journey,

00:00:35.114 --> 00:00:40.203
I spent years reading papers,
talking to scientists,

00:00:40.244 --> 00:00:43.623
and I always asked them the same question:

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:45.833
What do you think about nuclear power?

00:00:46.709 --> 00:00:49.462
Their responses were shockingly similar.

00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:51.964
It's good.

00:00:52.006 --> 00:00:53.132
We need it.

00:00:53.508 --> 00:00:55.176
People hate it.

00:00:56.844 --> 00:00:58.513
In the last seven years,

00:00:58.554 --> 00:01:03.184
I've seen climate change go
from being a scary thing of the future